{"speciesId":199,"names":{"fr":"Roigada","es":"Slowking","en":"Slowking","ja":"ヤドキング"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It has incredible intellect and in­ tuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"When its head was bitten, toxins entered SLOWPOKE's head and unlocked an extraordinary power."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Every time it ya­ wns, SHELLDER injects more poi­ son into it. The poison makes it more intelligent."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SLOWKING undertakes research every day in an effort to solve the mysteries of the world. However, this POKéMON apparently forgets everything it has learned if the SHELLDER on its head comes off."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SLOWKING undertakes research every day in an effort to solve the mysteries of the world. However, this POKéMON apparently forgets everything it has learned if the SHELLDER on its head comes off."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It undertakes research every day to solve the mysteries of the world. However, it apparently forgets everything if the SHELLDER on its head comes off."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When its head was bitten, toxins entered SLOWPOKE’s head and unlocked an extraordinary power."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It has incredible intellect and intuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Being bitten by SHELLDER gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Being bitten by SHELLDER gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Being bitten by SHELLDER gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It has incredible intellect and intuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When its head was bitten, toxins entered SLOWPOKE’s head and unlocked an extraordinary power."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La morsure de Kokiyas a fait de lui un génie dont l’intelligence rivalise avec celle d’un prix Nobel."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La morsure de Kokiyas a fait de lui un génie dont l’intelligence rivalise avec celle d’un prix Nobel."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"D’une grande intelligence, il sait rester calme, même en situation stressante."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su intelecto e intuición son increíbles. No pierde la compostura en ninguna situación."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has incredible intellect and intuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"すごい 知性と ひらめきを 持っている。どんなときでも あわてず 騒がず のんびりとしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Une fois sa tête mordue, des toxines ont envahi Ramoloss et lui ont conféré des pouvoirs immenses."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al ser mordido en la cabeza, Slowpoke absorbió unas toxinas que liberaron su oculto poder."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When its head was bitten, toxins entered Slowpoke’s head and unlocked an extraordinary power."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"かまれたとき 頭に 染みこんだ 毒素に よって ただならない 能力に 目覚めた ヤドン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tous les jours, Roigada entreprend des recherches pour résoudre les mystères du monde. Cependant, ce Pokémon oublie tout ce qu’il a appris si le Kokiyas qui se trouve sur sa tête s’en va."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Slowking dedica cada día tiempo a investigar, en un intento por resolver los misterios del mundo. Aunque, según parece, a este Pokémon se le olvida todo lo que ha aprendido si se separa del Shellder que lleva en la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Slowking undertakes research every day in an effort to solve the mysteries of the world. However, this Pokémon apparently forgets everything it has learned if the Shellder on its head comes off."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"世界の 不思議を 解明 するため 毎日 研究 しているが 頭の シェルダーが 外れると 全部 忘れてしまう らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tous les jours, Roigada entreprend des recherches pour résoudre les mystères du monde. Cependant, ce Pokémon oublie tout ce qu’il a appris si le Kokiyas qui se trouve sur sa tête s’en va."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Slowking dedica cada día tiempo a investigar, en un intento por resolver los misterios del mundo. Aunque, según parece, a este Pokémon se le olvida todo lo que ha aprendido si se separa del Shellder que lleva en la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Slowking undertakes research every day in an effort to solve the mysteries of the world. However, this Pokémon apparently forgets everything it has learned if the Shellder on its head comes off."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"世界の 不思議を 解明 するため 毎日 研究 しているが 頭の シェルダーが 外れると 全部 忘れてしまう らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Les toxines injectées dans son corps quand il s’est fait mordre ont fait de lui un génie. Ses pouvoirs psy ont été grandement amplifiés."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"El veneno de Shellder le confiere una inteligencia brillante. Puede utilizar sus poderes psíquicos con gran destreza."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"A poisonous bite reacted with its system, blessing it with the enhanced intellect of a genius. It has full control of its psychic powers."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"噛まれた 毒素の 影響で 天才的 頭脳の 持ち主に。 サイコパワーを 自在に 操る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il est tellement intelligent qu’il existe un proverbe dans certaines régions qui dit : « Si tu ne sais pas, demande au Roigada. »"},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es muy famoso por su inteligencia y, en algunas regiones, hasta tienen un refrán que dice: “En caso de duda, pregúntale a Slowking”."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon is so famed for its intellect that a proverb still persists in some regions: “When in doubt, ask Slowking.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"迷ったら ヤドキングに聞け という ことわざが 残る 地域も あるほど 賢いことで 有名 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il trouve tout le temps des idées formidables qui pourraient changer le monde, mais il les oublie dans la foulée."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A menudo se le ocurren ideas geniales que cambiarían el mundo, pero tan pronto como las tiene se le olvidan."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s constantly coming up with new ideas that would change the world, but as soon as it hits upon a new idea, it forgets it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"頭の 中では 常に 世界を 変えるような アイデアが わきだして いるが ひらめく端から 忘れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On l’appelle « le Grand Sage des mers ». Ses fréquents concours d’intelligence avec Gouroutan se terminent souvent par une égalité."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lo llaman el Sabio del Mar. Disfruta librando duelos de inteligencia con Oranguru que suelen terminar en tablas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s called “the sage of the sea.” It engages in battles of wits with Oranguru, but the result is usually a draw."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"海の 賢者と 呼ばれる。 ヤレユータンと 知恵比べを するが 結果は だいたい 引き分け。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les toxines du Kokiyas ont imprégné le cerveau du Ramoloss, réveillant en lui une intelligence insoupçonnée, comme par miracle."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Las toxinas del Shellder impregnaron el cerebro del anfitrión y despertaron el increíble intelecto oculto que poseía Slowpoke."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Miraculously, this former Slowpoke’s latent intelligence was drawn out when Shellder poison raced through its brain."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"シェルダーの 毒素が ヤドンの 脳みそを 駆けめぐり 奇跡的に 秘めた 知能を 覚醒させた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est capable de résoudre tous les problèmes qu’on lui présente, mais personne ne parvient à comprendre ce qu’il dit."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es capaz de dar respuesta a cualquier cuestión que se le formule, pero, por desgracia, nadie logra descifrar una sola palabra de lo que dice."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Slowking can solve any problem presented to it, but no one can understand a thing Slowking says."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"尋ねれば どんな 難題でも 解決してくれるが ヤドキングの 言葉は だれも 理解できない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":199,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"level-up"